{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2807-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>兩日前(10日)，民政事務總署公布「我在山優化計劃」，將分階段清拆存在於深水埗主教山多年的僭建構築物。第一階段範圍由唐山樓旁嘅山坡休憩處山腳到山頂，第二階段則覆蓋巴域街附近嘅山腳至山頂一段。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2834-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>現時第二階段範圍仲保留多組健身設施同神像，現場可見居民喺度踢毽、打乒乓球同使用健身器材。而唐山樓旁嘅山坡休憩處，昨晚已架設鐵絲網同圍板，今早更有保安駐守，禁止居民進入。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_3017-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2999-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2938-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2637-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2292-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2304-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2303-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2572-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2651-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2567-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2671-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2667-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2495-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2508-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2465-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-12T09:01:08.681182+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":18,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}